#: includes/Admin/Page.php:418
msgid "E-mail me when"
msgstr "Send mig en e-mail, når"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:419
msgid "a share fails"
msgstr "en deling mislykkes"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:420
msgid "an item was shared"
msgstr "et indlæg er blevet delt"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:421
msgid "You get one e-mail per item. A failed share is reported after SmokyPost has tried several times, and the same problem on the same platform is reported once a day. An e-mail that a connection has expired is always sent."
msgstr "Du får én e-mail pr. indlæg. En mislykket deling meldes, efter at SmokyPost har prøvet flere gange, og det samme problem på den samme platform meldes én gang om dagen. E-mailen om, at en forbindelse er udløbet, sendes altid."

